# CR 614.1c / 707.2 / 614.12: Primal Clay's own R:Event$ Moved | Layer$ Copy replacement
# is a GenericChoice of three Clone modes. The controller picks mode 2, the 1/6
# Wall with defender (GroundMold 0, AirMold 1, WallMold 2). Primal Clay's
# printed */* is 0/0 and would die to the next state-based action check; the
# 1/6 it entered as survives it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 U
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue abilitychoice 2
castspell human 1
resolvestack
# Leave Main1: the state-based action check a 0/0 would not survive.
advance
